      "widgets_values": [
        "## Models\n\nThis template downloads its own weights on first start — **14.3 GB** total, into the bucket:\n\n```\n📂 models/\n├── 📂 diffusion_models/\n│   └── minimax_music3_dit_fp16.safetensors                        4.9 GB\n├── 📂 text_encoders/\n│   └── minimax_music3_text_encoder_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors  9.2 GB\n└── 📂 vae/\n    └── minimax_music3_dav.safetensors                             0.2 GB\n```\n\nThe three loader nodes inside the subgraph carry these URLs themselves, which is what the\nlaunch script reads to fetch them — so nothing is hard-coded outside the graph.\n\nLower-VRAM variant: Comfy-Org also publishes `minimax_music3_dit_int8_convrot.safetensors`\n(2.5 GB) in the same repo under `diffusion_models/`. Swapping the UNETLoader to it halves the\ndiffusion model at some quality cost. It is deliberately not linked here as a URL: the launch\nscript downloads every HuggingFace `.safetensors` URL it finds anywhere in the graph, so a\nsecond link would pull 2.5 GB this workflow never loads."
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    }
